---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import scene from '@/assets/s1c-caqueta-20260819.png';
---

<section class="hero container">
  <div class="hero__text">
    <p class="eyebrow">Applied AI Scientist · Ph.D. · Geospatial AI</p>
    <h1 class="hero__name">Josiah&nbsp;W.<span>Smith</span></h1>
    <p class="hero__thesis">
      <span class="hero__abstract">Abstract—</span>I build deep learning systems that use the <em
        >physics of the sensor</em
      >: synthetic aperture radar, complex-valued neural networks, and geospatial foundation models.
    </p>
    <div class="hero__cta">
      <a class="btn" href="/projects">See the projects</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/blog">Read the blog</a>
      <a class="link-arrow" href="/cv">Full CV →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figure class="hero__fig">
    <div class="fig__frame">
      <div class="fig__strip" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>S1C · IW · GRDH · γ⁰ VV</span>
        <span>ASC / REL. ORBIT 47</span>
      </div>
      <div class="fig__canvas">
        <Image
          src={scene}
          alt="Sentinel-1C radar backscatter image of the Caquetá and Huila departments of Colombia, a tilted acquisition footprint showing forested lowlands, Andean foothills, and a meandering river"
          widths={[700, 1400]}
          sizes="(max-width: 52rem) 92vw, 42rem"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
        <!-- Printed marks (ink) + reviewer's pen (signal) over the scene.
             Image scale from the STAC bbox: 199.5 m/px, so 50 km = 251 px. -->
        <svg class="fig__marks" viewBox="0 0 1400 1079" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">
          <!-- scale bar -->
          <g class="mark-ink">
            <path d="M 60 1006 v 16 M 60 1014 h 251 M 311 1006 v 16"></path>
            <text x="66" y="994" class="mark-label mark-label--ink">50 km</text>
          </g>
          <!-- pen: loop around the meander belt -->
          <g class="mark-pen">
            <path
              d="M 1150 490 C 1252 462, 1310 560, 1292 682 C 1276 793, 1212 856, 1148 824 C 1086 792, 1082 642, 1104 560 C 1118 512, 1128 496, 1164 484"
            ></path>
            <path d="M 1176 962 C 1214 908, 1240 850, 1250 790"></path>
            <path d="M 1236 806 L 1250 790 L 1256 810"></path>
            <text x="1080" y="1006" class="mark-label mark-label--pen">meander belt</text>
          </g>
          <!-- pen: arrow into the foothill terrain -->
          <g class="mark-pen">
            <path d="M 205 92 C 268 142, 330 208, 388 268"></path>
            <path d="M 366 262 L 388 268 L 378 246"></path>
            <text x="40" y="72" class="mark-label mark-label--pen">Andean foothills</text>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figcaption class="fig__cap">
      Fig.&nbsp;1 — Sentinel-1C IW GRDH, γ⁰ VV, 2026-08-19 23:20&thinsp;UTC, ascending, rel. orbit
      47. Caquetá&thinsp;/&thinsp;Huila, Colombia (1.9°&thinsp;N, 75.9°&thinsp;W). Contains modified
      Copernicus Sentinel data (2026), processed on Microsoft Planetary Computer.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 0.5rem + 4vw, 4rem);
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 1.5rem + 4vw, 5rem);
  }
  .hero__name {
    font-size: var(--fs-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-stretch: 115%;
    line-height: 0.94;
    letter-spacing: 0.005em;
    margin-top: var(--sp-4);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .hero__name span {
    display: block;
  }
  .hero__thesis {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 34ch;
    margin-top: var(--sp-5);
  }
  .hero__abstract {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .hero__thesis em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .hero__cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--sp-4);
    margin-top: var(--sp-6);
  }

  /* --- Figure 1: the real scene (the signature) --- */
  .hero__fig {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .fig__frame {
    border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper);
  }
  .fig__strip {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--sp-4);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-3xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.55rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .fig__canvas {
    position: relative;
    padding: 0.55rem;
  }
  .fig__canvas :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .fig__marks {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0.55rem;
    width: calc(100% - 1.1rem);
    height: calc(100% - 1.1rem);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .mark-ink path {
    stroke: var(--ink);
    stroke-width: 2.5;
    fill: none;
  }
  .mark-pen path {
    stroke: var(--signal);
    stroke-width: 3.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    fill: none;
  }
  .mark-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 32px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .mark-label--ink {
    fill: var(--ink);
  }
  .mark-label--pen {
    fill: var(--signal-ink);
  }
  .fig__cap {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-3xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--mist);
    margin-top: var(--sp-3);
    padding-left: 0.1rem;
    max-width: 46rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--sp-6);
    }
  }
</style>
